flowchart LR
    accTitle: M2 delivery lifecycle sequence
    accDescr: A single request moves through ask, route, build, review, quality, publish, settlement, merge, proof, and learning. Findings return to build and unresolved threads return to review.
    A["1 · Ask<br/>Intent intake"] --> B["2 · Route<br/>Model + effort"]
    B --> C["3 · Build<br/>Plan / implement"]
    C --> D["4 · Review<br/>Thermos"]
    D --> E["5 · Quality<br/>Browser-visible check"]
    E --> F["6 · Publish<br/>Commit / publish"]
    F --> G["7 · Settle<br/>Review settlement"]
    G --> H["8 · Merge<br/>Base branch"]
    H --> I["9 · Prove<br/>Post-merge check"]
    I --> J["10 · Learn<br/>Durable receipt"]
    D -->|findings return| C
    G -->|unresolved threads return| D
